### Get all Posts
GET http://localhost:4000/posts/1234 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create Post
POST http://localhost:4000/posts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Typescript tutorial for Beginners",
    "postType": "post",
    "slug": "typescript-tutorial-for-beginners",
    "status": "draft",
    "content": "This is the content for my Post",
    "schema": "{\r\n \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\r\n \"@type\": \"Person\"\r\n}",
    "featuredImageUrl": "http://localhost.com/images/my-post-title.jpg",
    "publishedOn": "2026-10-18T13:50:01.945Z",
    "metaOptions": {
        "metaValue": "{\"sidebarEnabled\": true, \"footerEnabled\": false, \"headerEnabled\": false}"
    },
    "authorId": 1,
    "tags": [4, 5]
}


### Update a post
PATCH http://localhost:4000/posts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 17,
    "tags": [6]
}


### Delete a Post
DELETE http://localhost:4000/posts/17 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json